      "english": "with keen respect for the Saṅgha: "
    },
    {
      "number": 40,
      "pali": "Ete saggā pakāsanti, ",
      "english": "they illuminate the heavens "
    },
    {
      "number": 41,
      "pali": "yattha te upapajjare. ",
      "english": "wherever they’re reborn. "
    },
    {
      "number": 42,
